Brand Manifesto

We believe energy should be earned, not borrowed.

That discipline compounds.

That helping your crew matters.

That showing up beats showing off.

That every small decision shapes the person you’ll become.

Wild Hawg isn’t here to make you someone else.

It’s here to remind you of the person you already decided to be.

Remember who you are.

Rewild your day.

One thing I particularly like is that the product isn’t portrayed as the hero. The customer is. The gummies become a tool that fits into a broader identity, which tends to create a stronger, more durable brand than focusing only on ingredients or caffeine.